henticate with Hopsworks and cache an API key in...\n  skills          Discover the Hopsworks skills (Markdown playbooks)...\n  sql             Run an ad-hoc SQL query.\n  superset        Superset commands (datasets, charts, dashboards).\n  td              Training dataset commands.\n  transformation  Transformation function commands.\n  trino           Trino commands (query, catalogs, schemas, tables).\n  update          Print the command to upgrade the ``hopsworks`` package.\n\nstderr: \nreturncode: 0", "images": null, "injected": false, "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_state": null, "reasoning_signature": null, "reasoning_message_id": null, "tool_calls": null, "name": "bash", "tool_call_id": "VYMavr8yn", "message_id": null}
